    "title": "Bourbon County delays talk on bitcoin mining noise issues - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jake Cooperman ,\n1 days ago BOURBON COUNTY, Kan. — A discussion to control the noise surrounding a Bitcoin mining facility in Bourbon County is tabled for now. A representative from Evolution Tech, the company behind the facility, was scheduled to make an appearance at today’s Bourbon County Commissioners meeting after several recent noise complaints. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
